  "exposure": "Selected first-row formulas, all shared formula definitions intersecting H:K, and cached metadata inspected. A subsequent integrity check reads C:F/H:K at fixed rows22 and I16+1 plus H18:K18 baseline summaries; only identity residuals retained. No response fitting, scoring, plotting or threshold analysis.",
  "limits": "Shared zeroing definitions are decoded and fixed-row cache identities checked. No full-history cache evaluation, physical validation, sensor-accuracy or correction-admission claim.",
  "interpretation": {
    "geometry": "D2 is consolidated height in cm; G2/H2 are consolidated outer/inner radii in cm. Cross-check against the separately extracted N4/N5/N6 geometry before use.",
    "engineering_shear_strain": "M22 = rotation_in_radians * (outer_radius + inner_radius) / (2*height) *100 percent.",
    "shear_stress": "N22 = 3*torque / (2*pi*(outer_radius^3-inner_radius^3)); using torque in N m and radii in cm, multiply by1000 for kPa.",
    "pressure": "P22 = K22 - initial_back_pressure; Q22 = P22 / I2. I2 is the cached initial mean effective stress, not nominal100kPa.",
    "normal_stress": "S22 converts processed axial-force channel J22 in N over consolidated area K10 in cm2 to kPa; T22 adds it to initial vertical effective stress and subtracts excess pressure. R22 subtracts excess pressure from initial radial effective stress.",
    "qualification": "These identify the processed first-row observation map, not the normal boundary control or instrument/membrane calibration. Shared source tokens subtract absolute H18 from each channel five columns to the right of its raw input. This applies a torque baseline to unlike units; ON/OFF labels do not establish operational switch behaviour. Provider clarification is required before admission."
  },
